title Input Aggregation and Canonicalization

participant Notebook
participant Pipeline
participant SourceInputs as Inputs/<view>
participant WorkspaceInputs as Workspaces/<view>/inputs
participant MetadataAgg as Metadata Aggregator
participant TaxonomyAgg as Taxonomy Aggregator

Notebook->Pipeline: prepare_workspace_inputs(context)
Pipeline->SourceInputs: Scan metadata patterns
Pipeline->SourceInputs: Scan taxonomy patterns

Pipeline->MetadataAgg: Concatenate metadata parts
MetadataAgg->MetadataAgg: Drop duplicate acc rows (keep latest)
MetadataAgg->WorkspaceInputs: Write metadata.csv

Pipeline->TaxonomyAgg: Concatenate taxonomy parts
TaxonomyAgg->TaxonomyAgg: Group by acc+taxon key columns
TaxonomyAgg->TaxonomyAgg: Sum total_count and self_count
TaxonomyAgg->WorkspaceInputs: Write taxonomy.csv

Pipeline->Notebook: Return metadata_df, taxonomy_df, output paths